stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Editing
  state Editing {
    [*] --> Clean
    Clean --> Dirty : type
    Dirty --> Saving : debounce
    Saving --> Clean : ok
    Saving --> Failed : error
    Failed --> Saving : retry
  }
  Editing --> Closed : close tab
  note right of Editing : Edits stay in memory on failure
